cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this poster or its code, please cite this work as below."
title: "R Environment for Environmental Sciences: Four Packages Worth Knowing"
abstract: >-
  Conference poster introducing four R packages -- renv, pins, testthat and
  rmarkdown -- that together close the practical reproducibility gap between
  raw data and published results in ecological research. Each panel maps one
  package onto one failure mode, and a central worked example combines all
  four. The repository holds the poster itself and the R script that
  generates its QR code.
